    MLServer -->|CPU image| LGBM["lightgbm"]
    MLServer -->|CPU image| ORT["onnxruntime 1.25.0"]
    MLServer -->|CUDA image| ORTGPU["onnxruntime-gpu 1.25.0"]

    %% Build-time
    AIPCCBase["AIPCC base images 3.6<br/>cpu-el9.8 / cuda-12.9-el9.8<br/>digest-pinned"] -->|base OS, Python 3.12, CUDA| MLServer
    RHAIIndex["RHEL AI PyPI index<br/>rhoai/3.6, hashed wheels"] -->|wheels, --require-hashes| MLServer

    %% Internal platform
    KServe["KServe"] -->|deploys as ServingRuntime| MLServer
