    KRP["kube-rbac-proxy"] -->|auth sidecar, HTTP 8080| MLServer
    Prometheus["Prometheus / UWM"] -->|scrape 8082| MLServer

    %% External services
    MLServer -.->|OTLP/gRPC insecure| OTLPCol["OTLP collector"]
    MLServer -.->|Kafka plaintext| KafkaBrokers["Kafka brokers"]

